Added $(REF truncate, std,file) for setting file size

$(REF truncate, std,file) allows resizing a file to a specified number of bytes.
If the file is larger than the target size, it is truncated. If it is smaller,
it is extended with zero bytes.

---
import std.file;

truncate("example.bin", 1024);
assert(getSize("example.bin") == 1024);
---
